# Probe Type

A PROBE object-type category used when listing added and new objects.

◇

attributes:
    - key: number
      name: Number
      rules: "[0 .. unconstrained] at 1 unit"
      type_spec: Nat
    - key: name
      name: Name
      rules: unconstrained
      type_spec: STRING
    - key: description
      name: Description
      rules: unconstrained
      type_spec: STRING
